#: 54231f71f19e4d36865f76ca521bf170
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin supports all unidirectional protocols supported by ArduPilot "
"including PPM. If bi-directiona protocols are used, like CRSF/ELRS, they "
"will need to use a full UART (DMA capable) instead, set to protocol \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚支持 ArduPilot 支持的所有单向协议，包括 PPM。如果使用双向协议（如 CRSF/ELRS），则需要改用完整的 UART（支持 "
"DMA），并将协议设置为「23」。"

