"The PixFlamingo-F767 supports up to 10 PWM outputs. The PWM is in 5 groups. "
"IF Dshot is used for an output, all outputs in its group must be DShot."
msgstr ""
"PixFlamingo-F767 最多支持 10 路 PWM 输出。PWM 分为 5 组。如果某路输出使用 DShot，则该组所有输出都必须使用 "
"DShot。"

